Subject: [PATCH] Document Glimmer on Modal, the Fireworks backup and the
 lesson library

doc/README.md covers the modal and fireworks providers, the fallback
chain, the lesson file format with a real example, the matching rule,
doc start and the verified Muse Code first prompt. docs/AGENT-HOOKS.md
records Muse's interactive initial prompt (muse "<prompt>", 1.4.14).
HACKATHON.md's model table, AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG and STATUS.md are
updated; STATUS records the undeployed Modal app and the Fireworks key
to rotate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
